  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nika Pharm II Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a senior secured loan of up to US$ 20 million to Nika Pharm  for financing (i) the upgrade of equipment to increase capacity, (ii) the  launch of GMP standard for medicines manufacturing requirements, and (iii)  balance sheet restructuring through debt consolidation.  The project aims to boost competitiveness and promote human capital  development. It will allow expanding pharmaceuticals production to meet growing  local demand. Nika Pharm will launch new training programmes tailored to its  needs, focusing on roles scarce in the local labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
